  <prompt>Replace PlaceholderInvariantVerifier's I1 branch (no hardcoded tenant) with a real on-disk grep of packaged scripts/content for tenant-shaped GUID defaults -- pure C#, zero live Azure dependencies per DS-4 §6, making this the easiest probe in the whole H13 suite to build and the correct FIRST one to land.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in H13's IE2ETrapVerifier/IE2EInvariantVerifier seam contracts and typed Azure SDK/REST post-condition verification.</role>

  <goal>I1's real verifier scans packaged content (scripts/content artifacts bundled into the L2 payload) for tenant-shaped GUID literals matching a documented default-tenant pattern, returning Fail if any are found and Pass otherwise. No live Azure call is made.</goal>

